      "complete": false,
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "one-server",
          "title": "Start with one server",
          "description": "Lia opens a sneaker page and places an order during a sale. Her phone sends both requests to the store app, and the app reads or writes the database before it replies. Both processes share one server. As traffic grows, look for rising response times and CPU contention on that machine.",
