          "id": "survive-region-outage",
          "title": "Keep the store reachable during an outage",
          "description": "Lia retries checkout after the primary region stops responding. Once the standby app is ready and its copy of the orders data is promoted for writes, DNS can point new lookups to the standby region. Existing DNS caches and replication lag can delay recovery. The retry reuses the same order ID so that a previous save can be recognized from the recovered data.",
